@startuml pipeline_simple
title Patent Translation Pipeline — Simple View

left to right direction

skinparam DefaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam DefaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ranksep 18
skinparam nodesep 10
skinparam ArrowColor #555
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor #888
  FontStyle bold
}

state "Load\n//open docx//"           as L  #EAF7EA
state "Classify\n//tag paragraphs//"   as C  #EAF7EA
state "Body\n//chunk + translate//"    as B  #FDF6E3
state "Abstract\n//chunk + translate//"  as A  #EAF1F8
state "Claims\n//classify → 2-stage translate//"  as CL #FCEAEA
state "Write\n//apply, preserve equations//"  as W  #EFEFFF

[*] --> L
L  --> C
C  --> B
B  --> A
A  --> CL
CL --> W
W  --> [*]

note bottom of B  : optional review pass
note bottom of A  : optional review pass
note bottom of CL : optional review pass
@enduml
